      "writtenOn": "2024-10-07T21:28:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For WebGPU calls that need access to the JS object, yea. We will almost certainly change the implementation here in some way in following changes, but this is just the simplest way to do it atm.",
      "parentUuid": "12776db4_a06dc43e",
      "revId": "155e1eb383ceab00930770ffeb3c50a6a798cdf0",
